<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>
<div class="row mt-4">
  <div class="col-8 offset-2">
    <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>We collect only the information needed to run your account and bookings: your username, email address and booking details.</p>
    <p>Passwords are stored as salted hashes and are never visible to us. Payments are processed by Razorpay; we do not store your card or UPI details.</p>
    <p>Your email is used only to send booking confirmations and cancellations.</p>
    <p>This is a demo project built for learning purposes.</p>
  </div>
</div>